{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Slightly Overweight Superhero and the seven levels of death",
    "steam_appid": 2472170,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Close your eyes. (Wait, no\u2014don\u2019t actually do that.) Open your third eye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2140. Elon made it to Mars. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bitcoin became the dominant world currency. And A.I.'s technology advanced to the level of genetically engineering the perfect human. But despite all of this, mankind still found a way of completely destroying Earth's atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     Enter you. A hero, not afraid to take on a few carbs. Yeah, you're a bit chubby. But that won\u2019t stop you from jumping headfirst into the neon wasteland. Life and Death are now as one. And when you die.\u00a0(oh, you will) Your soul is instantly uploaded to the Cloud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a legendary journey through 5 surreal worlds and brave the 7 Levels of Death. Gather hundreds of unique collectables and crack cryptic codes to uncover all 27 sacred Golden Tablets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Cloud</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here you must capture soul fragments to regenerate your life. Once you have collected enough soul fragments, A shop becomes available. You can now purchase various upgrades and synthesize yourself a new organic host. But beware! you can also die in the Cloud. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dying in the Cloud will cast you down to the 2nd level of death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I think you see where this is going? Yes, 7 levels of death. Each level challenging you with a completely different style and genre of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/SOS-Gif-the_cloud_small.gif?t=1754175663\" /></span>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/67c6f8ecebb383b4738c5017f6e48883.avif?t=1754175663\" /></span>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2nd level of death</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scramble your way through an electrified maze all while racing against the clock. Every time you touch an electric wall your time will be reduced. Caution! if you touch the red laser beams you die instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/46f7f8721156d0c539d91255c0eadde1.poster.avif?t=1754175663\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/46f7f8721156d0c539d91255c0eadde1.webm?t=1754175663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/46f7f8721156d0c539d91255c0eadde1.mp4?t=1754175663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/d5b0ff4f04a07c31813c32085420c03b.avif?t=1754175663\" /></span>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3rd level of death</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival is the name of the game.  You must take control of your armour-plated vehicle, we call them 'Runners'. Fight your way to salvation in an old school Shoot 'Em Up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/a58b036b2f6bf3982bfe826c98a6ec19.poster.avif?t=1754175663\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/a58b036b2f6bf3982bfe826c98a6ec19.webm?t=1754175663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/a58b036b2f6bf3982bfe826c98a6ec19.mp4?t=1754175663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/84cb2d313c1e531167ad2934d7b73282.avif?t=1754175663\" /></span>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4th level of death</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your brain will have to get you out of this one. Answer enough questions right to complete the Slightly Overweight Superhero Quiz show.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/176aa56de5804a4ce99d8e021fddc073.poster.avif?t=1754175663\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/176aa56de5804a4ce99d8e021fddc073.webm?t=1754175663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/176aa56de5804a4ce99d8e021fddc073.mp4?t=1754175663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/56eae26aef9ed382bf5e73554a8dd9a1.avif?t=1754175663\" /></span>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5th level of death</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wanted to swing through a relentless barrage of spiralling neon walls? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, this is the stage for you. Here, you must time the gap, release your hero. And collect all 30 soul fragments to avoid the ever-present hammer of fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/cc1d65c21b26fdbb4ab2cd22d67952cb.poster.avif?t=1754175663\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/cc1d65c21b26fdbb4ab2cd22d67952cb.webm?t=1754175663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/cc1d65c21b26fdbb4ab2cd22d67952cb.mp4?t=1754175663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/20cda9f6f95acac434bfb36bb3145498.avif?t=1754175663\" /></span>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6th level of death</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to shake your money maker. Tap your way to the rhythm and shred yourself a heart pumping victory. All while listening to 3 Unreleased tracks from Australian Rock Band 'Birds of the Sun'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/5d725d136f0cea2891cc2ec845f9a7b2.poster.avif?t=1754175663\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/5d725d136f0cea2891cc2ec845f9a7b2.webm?t=1754175663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/5d725d136f0cea2891cc2ec845f9a7b2.mp4?t=1754175663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/58dfc6acdd25bd338fca0d44ada05a3d.avif?t=1754175663\" /></span>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then the 7th level of death, your last chance at life. Let's just say, it's something you have to experience for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/c0f3cefda96d01ad6d6af58c7c70ce19.avif?t=1754175663\" /></span>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/5b4de51f75ece64140559f0fdbe2f20b.avif?t=1754175663\" /></span>.</p>",
