re, you must time the gap, release your hero. And collect all 30 soul fragments to avoid the ever-present hammer of fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/cc1d65c21b26fdbb4ab2cd22d67952cb.poster.avif?t=1754175663\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/cc1d65c21b26fdbb4ab2cd22d67952cb.webm?t=1754175663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/cc1d65c21b26fdbb4ab2cd22d67952cb.mp4?t=1754175663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/20cda9f6f95acac434bfb36bb3145498.avif?t=1754175663\" /></span>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6th level of death</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to shake your money maker. Tap your way to the rhythm and shred yourself a heart pumping victory. All while listening to 3 Unreleased tracks from Australian Rock Band 'Birds of the Sun'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/5d725d136f0cea2891cc2ec845f9a7b2.poster.avif?t=1754175663\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/5d725d136f0cea2891cc2ec845f9a7b2.webm?t=1754175663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/5d725d136f0cea2891cc2ec845f9a7b2.mp4?t=1754175663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.</