    "short_description": "In 2140, death isn't the end\u2014it's just the upload. Play as a slightly out-of-shape hero jumping, rolling, and respawning across five surreal worlds. Unlock secrets, dodge traps, and survive the Cloud's Seven Levels of Death\u2026 all without losing a single calorie.",
